    "detailed_description": "<strong>City Car Driving 2.0</strong> is a realistic car simulator that will help novice drivers master basic car driving skills in conditions as close to reality as possible.<br> <br>Artificial intelligence monitors compliance with traffic rules, player behavior on the road, which helps to consolidate practical skills and theoretical knowledge of traffic rules.  <br><br>Cars physical model realism and dynamic weather conditions provide a deep immersion in the World, challenging even experienced drivers.<br><br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong><br>\u2022\tElaborated game controls that include both manual and automatic gearbox, and end-to-end driver preparation<br>\u2022\tPlayer\u2019s car customization<br>\u2022\tChoice of common vehicle types<br>\u2022\tCar simulator physics and ambient sounds as realistic as possible<br>\u2022\tDynamically changing times of the day and weather conditions<br>\u2022\tDiverse environment for exploration: city, forest, etc.<br>\u2022\tNumerous game modes",
